Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:37.17,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 11: THE COUNCILOR
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:38.32,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Well, it's good I found her, \Nbut what are they up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:42.73,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,This reeks of a romantic \Nrendezvous. Not a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:44.95,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You know this won't fly, Miss Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:46.45,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.64,0:01:55.21,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Miss Luna. I was wondering where \Nyou ran off to, but what's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:01:59.38,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It's a good thing \NI'm the one who found you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:03.05,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but this sorta thing is gonna \Nget you another council meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:06.66,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Seriously, would you cut it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:10.10,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I hate those meetings, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:12.11,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Are you even—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:12.11,Default - Top,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:16.11,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:21.62,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,After the riot back there, \Nthe air got really thick with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:22.70,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:26.87,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:30.51,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,This is the kid? The cursed youngling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.93,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,What the heck, kid? This ain't gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.55,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Why are you still such \Na scrawny little runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:45.32,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I guess it's just like Flame said. \NNo point in letting you live, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:51.98,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The cursed youngling. That label again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:55.98,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,A name I don't know, but one \Nthat damns me all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:57.39,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:01.43,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:24.83,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:28.81,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Miss Witch—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:32.00,Default,Townsperson 1,0,0,0,,Found him! He's over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:35.64,Default,Townsperson 1,0,0,0,,He used some kind of weird fan to \Nrip the prophet's body to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:37.24,Default,Townsperson 1,0,0,0,,I saw the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:40.82,Default,Townsperson 2,0,0,0,,Wait. Is that the poison mushroom witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.53,Default,Townsperson 3,0,0,0,,So they were working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:45.03,Default,Townsperson 2,0,0,0,,Go get the authorities!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:50.04,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Looks like we're caught. \NI guess we should split.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:53.42,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,We'll have to find a safer \Nplace to talk, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.30,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,I know a safe place we could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.41,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.30,Italics,White Magician (M),0,0,0,,Isn't that Henri?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:11.31,Italics,White Magician (M),0,0,0,,I didn't even need to summon him. \NMy assistant was already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:13.81,Italics,White Magician (M),0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:17.35,Italics,White Magician (M),0,0,0,,this outlaw rabble before me is \Nwhat everyone is up in arms about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:21.70,Italics,White Magician (M),0,0,0,,Isn't that the crown prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:26.37,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.83,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,Henri! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.58,Default,White Magician,0,0,0,,Apprehend them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:36.58,Italics,White Magician (M),0,0,0,,Wind... magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.62,Default,Townsperson 2,0,0,0,,Where did they go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:39.18,Default,Townsperson 1,0,0,0,,They just disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:51.47,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You didn't smell like a liar,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:55.60,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and we were in a rush, so I decided \Nto take your advice, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:05.74,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,So, where the heck are we?\N Is this your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:08.01,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Actually, this is—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:09.35,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:12.29,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm so pooped!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:15.93,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,First I had to blast\N The End of All Things,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.93,0:05:18.81,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,then teleport four people and two animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I've been working so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:26.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but nobody ever thanks me!\N I mean, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.36,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:30.75,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Every word he says is garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:34.65,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,And you-know-who never \Neven offers to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:38.87,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I mean, would it kill ya to grab me\N a glass of lemonade or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:41.51,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,No, more than a glass or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:44.15,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,This room, with the way \Nvoices echo in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:44.15,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,I'd need three, or four, \Nor five, or six, or seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.87,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,seems familiar for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:48.16,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Nah, I'd need more than lemonade. \NMaybe a really good meal instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.31,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:53.47,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Ice cream, cake... something sweet. \NI wanna eat something nice and sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:57.79,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I really deserve a lot \Nmore praise than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.17,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,And I'm starving! Get me some food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:06.01,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll quit this gig. I just \Nain't cut out to be a black witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:07.50,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,It's such a scam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:09.29,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to \Nfind out I know this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:09.71,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,I wish I could work from bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:15.14,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,Wait, if I could work from bed, does \Nthat mean I would get to sleep all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:12.92,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Should I shut him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.62,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:21.11,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,They brought some lemonade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:24.19,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Gotta get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:30.66,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Like you guys were saying,\N I'm one of the council witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:32.20,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,The Wind Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.69,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,And you... Lize, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:39.96,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm the person sent to \Nadminister your surprise exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:45.71,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and decide your fate \Nas a cursed youngling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.87,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Basically, whether you live \Nor die is all up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:54.47,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Sucks to meet like this, \Nbut let's get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:09.38,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Recently, sometimes the \Nthings I write in my diary
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:12.41,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,don't match up with what I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:18.50,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The magical paper that Miss Witch \Ngave me is made from mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:23.15,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,When I write in it, the bad \Nmemories turn into yuck-shrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.10,0:07:32.61,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I felt kind of sad and uncomfortable \Nwatching the yuck-shrooms float away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:37.80,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,so I decided to secretly \Nkeep another diary, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:43.06,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Sometimes, I find things written in that \Ndiary that I have no recollection of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:47.97,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Even feelings and memories \Nthat would seem unforgettable
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.37,0:07:52.95,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,feel like they belong to some \Nother person that I've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:08:00.59,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,My legs get cold, like I'm on the verge\N of tumbling into a bottomless darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.83,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Other things also don't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:09.55,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I wanted to hurry and catch up to Miss \NWitch, so I measured my height every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:16.02,Flashback,Tree Spirit,0,0,0,,Well, this is strange. I'm quite certain\N you were taller yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:18.45,Flashback,Tree Spirit,0,0,0,,Why does it seem you've gotten smaller?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:24.46,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Suddenly, I remembered one time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:30.17,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,when Miss Witch had removed an animal's \Npoison and turned it into a mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:38.66,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:44.03,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,It seems like this fellow is smaller \Nnow that you've absorbed his poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:45.83,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:50.31,Flashback,Lize,0,0,0,,Stay away from that! \NHe sure doesn't learn, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:55.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It was strange when the rabbit went \Nright back to the bug that stung him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.48,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,as if nothing had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:02.44,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Miss Witch looked like she \Nrealized she'd committed a sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:10.77,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Also, I can't explain how, \Nwhenever I was feeling bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:14.45,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I would wake up the next \Nmorning completely refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:21.87,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,My questions became doubts, \Nand as they collected deep inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:24.06,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I felt like they were \Nstarting to suffocate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:30.81,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Why could I only grasp a vague \Noutline of these doubts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:34.38,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Why couldn't I trace them \Nback to their source?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:41.89,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,There was something I had to hold \Nclose to my heart and protect,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:45.31,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,no matter how painful it became. \NSomething that I must not lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:48.85,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,There was nothing more terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.04,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,more frightening than the \Nthought of losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:56.65,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I strained my eyes to try to see \Nthe source of this restlessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:00.03,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,so I could confront it, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.19,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.13,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.53,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize just came to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:19.44,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:20.97,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:27.13,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,The wind guy was such a jerk, \Nit made you sick. We were worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:28.44,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,What's your problem, bull?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:31.12,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I was unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:32.10,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:38.03,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You make Luna manage your poison \Nbecause you can't do it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.79,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,What a pathetic kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:46.95,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Was Miss Witch trying to \Nextract my poison just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:50.87,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I just got done saying \N"nice to meet you"...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:52.47,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.47,0:10:56.46,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but at this rate, it's already \Nlike "farewell." Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:11:00.41,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I know you had a pretty generous \Ngrace period before I showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.25,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,What were you doing that whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:07.77,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize, don't run. I've got \Nto get the poison out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:12.89,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Wow, would you quit \Nlooking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:15.19,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Nobody's looking at you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:19.99,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm really not doing this \Njob by choice to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.99,0:11:23.63,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I happened to skip one little \Nmeeting and they stuck me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:25.43,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:28.34,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,I can do it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.46,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Quit acting so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:34.59,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,We know you can't, that's \Nwhy Luna's trying to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:36.91,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,I mean, I already had plans I couldn't \Nback out of, and they treat me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:37.81,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:39.46,Default - Top,Gus,0,0,0,,It's true I kinda wasn't \Nin the mood, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:42.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I can't let Miss Witch take \Naway any more of my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:47.15,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I never want to make her doubt \Nherself like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:56.27,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,This is way rougher on me \Nthan you. Yeah, poor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:12:00.83,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,So grin and bear it and don't \Nhold it against me, Lize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:06.78,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Just accept my judgment \Nand die for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:11.56,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Would you quit your endless \Nblabbing for once, damn it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.54,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:21.21,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,What?! I'm a great magician here, \Nya crow-brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:23.43,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Show me some respect, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:25.74,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,If you don't, I'm gonna tell Flame on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:29.44,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,Caw! Caw! Caw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:34.81,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,Caw! Caw! Caw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.78,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:29.44,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Stop it, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:32.84,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Please do something, Miss Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:41.32,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,That guy is really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:45.82,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I've never seen Luna glare at someone \Nwith that much contempt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:51.33,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's pretty rare to find someone \Nwith no redeeming qualities at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:56.33,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Aren't the council members supposed to \Nbe really important black magicians?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.84,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,So why do you act so polite to Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:03.59,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,I'm always polite to people I respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:09.60,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh, you are? Well, I'm glad that \Nyou respect Luna. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:14.85,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Also, as a magician, \NMiss Luna is still my senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:17.94,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I guess you do have decent \Nmanners after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.25,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Yeah, I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:22.65,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,I wish the crow would take \Na page out of your book.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:23.38,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:28.20,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,As a fancy council member, you'd think \Nneeding emotional support from a bull
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:31.87,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,would make the others think \Ntwice about that jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.89,0:13:43.77,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I wonder what sort of experiences \NMiss Witch and that man shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:51.49,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,They refuse to look at each other, \Nas if they can't face their emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:53.81,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I get the feeling that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:57.57,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,unlike me, he has had some kind of \Nunforgettable experience with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:58.90,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and it's suffocating to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:00.37,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:03.99,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,If I can't remember my time \Nwith her, no matter how long,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.75,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,it might as well have never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:10.35,Default - Top,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize, what's wrong? Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.38,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Like my memories and my growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:12.78,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,this bittersweet suffering will \Ncontinually be stolen from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:16.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,as long as I remain a cursed youngling \Nwho cannot stand on his own two feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:16.67,Default - Top,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize? Don't struggle. \NIt will be okay. Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:19.70,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Since we can't truly share \Na connection with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:22.59,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,even when I'm with her, \Nit feels like we're both alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:29.18,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,By spending time with her, it feels like \NI'm only intensifying her loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.57,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And I hate that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.18,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Lize?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:38.76,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:46.19,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:49.30,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Is that wolfsbane?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:02.38,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Lize, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:12.23,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,He discharged poison from his body \Nto grow poisonous wolfsbane instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.83,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,It's a touching gesture,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:17.31,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,but if expelling a drop of poison\N tires him this much,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.45,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,there's not much point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:22.20,Default,Lize,0,0,0,,Don't take it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.28,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:33.06,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I want to be like him and grow into \Na person who is worthy of Miss Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:38.93,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,But at this moment, there's nobody \Nless worthy of her than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:45.96,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Someday, I may even lose all \Nof the feelings I hold for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:51.47,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,If I lose sight of the kindness \Nand sadness reflected in her eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:57.43,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,as she was forced to pull the memories \Nout of me with her own two hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:01.23,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I may not be able to see her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:09.74,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Even as I cling to her, these precious \Nmoments between us will melt away,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.13,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,drop by drop, \Nand there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:18.28,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,By staying with her, this person \NI care for more than anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:25.53,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,I may end up pushing her into \Na loneliness even darker than solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:36.52,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Yeah, but then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:41.58,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,rattled as Luna is right now, maybe it's \Nbest she doesn't try to use her magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:49.71,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Oh, I tried to ask, but \Nwhere the heck are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:52.28,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,There's been no reaction to us showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.99,0:16:55.49,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Must be a room somewhere in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:58.49,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,With a really strong barrier on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:17:00.74,Default,Henri,0,0,0,,Well, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:05.27,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Hiding right under their noses might \Nbe safer than risking it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:08.25,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But if this ain't your place, \Nwho's it belong to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.91,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,There are tons of birds everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:15.54,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Even the furniture and decorations \Nare covered with birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:17.29,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,A real bird freak must live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:20.29,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:24.42,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Whoever owns this place must \Nbe as dumb as he is obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.14,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But I do get a feeling I've \Nheard about it somewhere—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:30.84,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Thank you for sharing your \Npainfully incisive opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:35.53,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I will take them into consideration \Nwhen I next renovate, Wind Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:41.64,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,It has been a while, yes? I'm glad you \Nhave found my home accommodating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:45.29,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,BIRD MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:50.97,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Master... Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:56.80,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Luna, I am glad to see you all well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:02.85,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,And Lize, nice meeting you. \NOr rather, nice {\i1}two{\i0} meet you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:06.35,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,I am the Bird Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:16.13,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Uh, don't get me wrong, Master Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:20.18,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,A minute ago my mouth was, yeah, \Npossessed by an evil spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:23.08,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,and it made me say things I didn't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.41,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:29.32,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,A black witch council member \Nwas possessed... by an evil spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:35.66,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Well, I better get to a sauna to steam \Nthat spirit out so I'll catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:37.98,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:41.09,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna let you get away \Nthat easy, you fraud of a magician?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:43.10,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse. Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.51,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse. Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:43.67,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Caw!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:47.67,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Who are you calling a fraud?!\N Ouch! Ouch! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:46.46,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse. Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:48.10,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional abuse. Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.96,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:52.92,Default,Owl,0,0,0,,Now, now, Claw. Stop that. \NWe are in Master Bird's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:56.36,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Wow! That bird just spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:18:58.39,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:01.69,Default,Owl,0,0,0,,My, you have such a foul mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:05.49,Default,Owl,0,0,0,,I am in the service of Master Bird\N as the butler of this manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.77,Default,Owl,0,0,0,,I am Maximilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:13.89,Default,Maximilian,0,0,0,,Please excuse this fledgling and \Naccept my most sincere apologies,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:15.15,Default,Maximilian,0,0,0,,Your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:24.76,Default,Maximilian,0,0,0,,He is not only a perpetual adolescent, \Nbut is also very obstinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:27.38,Default,Maximilian,0,0,0,,Claw, apologize to His Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:29.89,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Claw?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:29.89,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:30.99,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:32.69,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Real sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:34.94,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,He isn't apologizing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:33.78,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.42,Default,Maximilian,0,0,0,,Now Claw,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:37.42,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:41.07,Default,Maximilian,0,0,0,,I don't mind how despicable and pathetic \Nyour behavior or appearance is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:41.07,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:45.86,Default,Maximilian,0,0,0,,but you must not treat \NMaster's guests with disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.78,Italics - Top,BGM,0,0,0,,Emotional Abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:48.12,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You said it, bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:51.34,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Now get along, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.92,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,The Bird Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:20:00.21,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,If he's the master here, \Nthen this must be Claude's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:02.20,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Home? Nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:09.67,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And yet, he looks just \Nlike a white magician...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.49,0:20:15.19,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and we're inside the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.97,0:20:19.74,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Still, it seems like he's one of \NMiss Witch's black magician friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:21.44,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:27.78,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Well then, let us no longer be distracted \Nby Windy's incessant babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:29.95,Default,Wind Spirits,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:31.96,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:34.46,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Oh... Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:40.46,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Regarding the book store owner \Nyou had intended to visit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:46.54,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,as he is part elf, the miasma spreading \Nin town had severely weakened him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:51.07,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,but I sent him one of my formulas, \Nso he is no longer in immediate danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:55.19,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Master Bird, you went out of your way...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:20:58.03,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:00.53,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Thank him, don't apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:06.85,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Judging from Wind's and Miss Witch's\N sudden change in demeanor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.85,0:21:12.84,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,and the crow's attitude, \Nthis must be a very important person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:17.89,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Isn't that a relief, Luna? \NBut while cleaning the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.89,0:21:20.85,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,you meant to take the bookseller \Nmedicine too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.85,0:21:24.55,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Why not use a mushroom to teleport \Nand drop in on him right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.25,0:21:30.76,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Perhaps that would not be ideal \Nfor Luna in her unstable state.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:35.14,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh? But why? \NWhy shouldn't she go see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:40.57,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Wait. Miss Witch... is unstable?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:44.27,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,Well, Miss Luna is afflicted \Nby a certain condition
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:48.53,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,that's taboo for black witches, \Nso her magic's weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:53.74,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,But it's pretty obvious Miss Luna \Nknows exactly what the cause is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:58.33,Default,Gus,0,0,0,,You should give me some credit for \Nnot spelling it out for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:02.81,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Taboo for black witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.41,0:22:05.19,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:09.13,Flashback,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,Love may be poison for black witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.13,0:22:11.45,Flashback,Green Spirit 3,0,0,0,,but it is a source of \Npower for white witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:19.61,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,A condition taboo for black witches?\N Her magic is weakened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:23.86,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,And she knows exactly what the cause is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:30.60,Italics,Lize (M),0,0,0,,It's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:41.50,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:46.17,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:52.14,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:10.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: \NLIZE, THE BLACK WITCH'S APPRENTICE
